  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u81040c00\" id=\"u81040c00\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue5fc8801\" id=\"ue5fc8801\">JSON(JavaScript Object Notation) 是一种轻量级的数据交换格式。 易于人阅读和编写。同时也易于机器解析和生成。 它基于</span><a href=\"http://www.crockford.com/javascript\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u9ace8699\" id=\"u9ace8699\"><span data-lake-id=\"u38b1a188\" id=\"u38b1a188\">JavaScript Programming Language</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u3b88807b\" id=\"u3b88807b\">, Standard ECMA-262 3rd Edition - December 1999的一个子集。 JSON采用完全独立于语言的文本格式，但是也使用了类似于C语言家族的习惯（包括C, C++, C#, Java, JavaScript, Perl, Python等）。 这些特性使JSON成为理想的数据交换语言。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ucba5ce9d\" id=\"ucba5ce9d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud6d99328\" id=\"ud6d99328\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uefae38ac\" id=\"uefae38ac\"><span data-lake-id=\"udafdf61e\" id=\"udafdf61e\">JSON主要有两种结构：</span></p><ol list=\"u6c89e2ac\"><li fid=\"ud7f2e9d4\" data-lake-id=\"u10d7b1ad\" id=\"u10d7b1ad\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf61de7ed\" id=\"uf61de7ed\">“名称/值”对的集合（A collection of name/value pairs）。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"ud79591f2\" id=\"ud79591f2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0f8d3d2f\" id=\"u0f8d3d2f\">不同的语言中，它被理解为对象（object），纪录（record），结构（struct），字典（dictionary），哈希表（hash table），有键列表（keyed list），或者关联数组 （associative array）。</span></p><ol list=\"ua3423d9b\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"u9b079842\" data-lake-id=\"u873a7d26\" id=\"u873a7d26\"><span data-lake-id=\"u12e2dcb5\" id=\"u12e2dcb5\">值的有序列表（An ordered list of values）。在大部分语言中，它被理解为数组（array）。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"uc5dbd9a9\" id=\"uc5dbd9a9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2231f64d\" id=\"u2231f64d\">这些都是常见的数据结构。事实上大部分现代计算机语言都以某种形式支持它们。这使得一种数据格式在同样基于这些结构的编程语言之间交换成为可能。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3000f813\" id=\"u3000f813\"><span data-lake-id=\"u621534cd\" id=\"u621534cd\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u377eb507\" id=\"u377eb507\"><span data-lake-id=\"u27f570ce\" id=\"u27f570ce\">JSON数据格式官网介绍：</span><a href=\"https://www.json.org/json-zh.html\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u355075b6\" id=\"u355075b6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u53e32042\" id=\"u53e32042\">https://www.json.org/json-zh.html</span></a></p><p data-lake-id=\"uffdedd4d\" id=\"uffdedd4d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue22e8fe8\" id=\"ue22e8fe8\">cJSON开源代码链接：</span><a href=\"https://github.com/DaveGamble/cJSON\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"uab578319\" id=\"uab578319\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue9f32fa1\" id=\"ue9f32fa1\">https://github.com/DaveGamble/cJSON</span></a></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"localdoc\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fattachments%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fzip%2F27903758%2F1720076180648-464594c8-0bb7-4edc-b08b-dcd457c242a6.zip%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22cJSON.zip%22%2C%22size%22%3A19844%2C%22ext%22%3A%22zip%22%2C%22source%22%3A%22%22%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22download%22%3Atrue%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u6ce04c17-e8cd-4e69-ae41-c83c6fe7f6a%22%2C%22taskType%22%3A%22transfer%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22application%2Fzip%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22card%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mzMjB%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u4c3a2a2a\" id=\"u4c3a2a2a\"><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"pNbjw\" id=\"pNbjw\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7c25d45a\" id=\"u7c25d45a\">JSON数据格式</span></h3><h4 data-lake-id=\"DRk2o\" id=\"DRk2o\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u03d58609\" id=\"u03d58609\">JSON对象</span></h4><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22json%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%5Ct%5Cn%20%20%5C%22name%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22zhangsan%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22age%5C%22%3A%2024%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22height%5C%22%3A%20175.3%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22b8pDK%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h4 data-lake-id=\"e9abU\" id=\"e9abU\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0fae2866\" id=\"u0fae2866\">JSON数组</span></h4><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22json%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5B%5Cn%20%20%5C%22China%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22America%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22Africa%5C%22%5Cn%5D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zrOs5%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22json%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5B%5Cn%20%20%7B%5Ct%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22name%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22zhangsan%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22age%5C%22%3A%2024%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22height%5C%22%3A%20175.3%5Cn%20%20%7D%2C%5Cn%20%20%7B%5Ct%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22name%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22lisi%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22age%5C%22%3A%2033%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22height%5C%22%3A%20168.5%5Cn%20%20%7D%5Cn%5D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oG1ik%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h4 data-lake-id=\"Nefi8\" id=\"Nefi8\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8a0fdc8b\" id=\"u8a0fdc8b\">对象和数组混合</span></h4><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22json%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%5Cn%20%20%5C%22name%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22Awesome%204K%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22support%5C%22%3A%20%5B720%2C%201080%2C%202160%5D%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22resolutions%5C%22%3A%20%5B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22width%5C%22%3A%201280%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22height%5C%22%3A%20720%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22width%5C%22%3A%201920%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22height%5C%22%3A%201080%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22width%5C%22%3A%203840%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22height%5C%22%3A%202160%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%5D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Y8406%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"Fyqv9\" id=\"Fyqv9\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u73b2dfcb\" id=\"u73b2dfcb\">JSON数据解析</span></h3><ul list=\"u2339dacd\"><li fid=\"uf2198490\" data-lake-id=\"u09acf667\" id=\"u09acf667\"><span data-lake-id=\"u277cb03f\" id=\"u277cb03f\">在AC79里解析JSON需要3件事</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u2339dacd\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"uf2198490\" data-lake-id=\"u2b21f145\" id=\"u2b21f145\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf3c48cfd\" id=\"uf3c48cfd\">添加头文件搜索路径：</span><code data-lake-id=\"ubf0380fd\" id=\"ubf0380fd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u44079d51\" id=\"u44079d51\">..\\..\\..\\..\\..\\include_lib\\net\\cJSON_common</span></code></li><li fid=\"uf2198490\" data-lake-id=\"u5e385dd4\" id=\"u5e385dd4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6ddc9d8c\" id=\"u6ddc9d8c\">添加动态链接库：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u04062594\" id=\"u04062594\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf89efa2c\" id=\"uf89efa2c\">../../../../../cpu/wl82/liba/cJSON.a</span></code></li><li fid=\"uf2198490\" data-lake-id=\"u7b344b1b\" id=\"u7b344b1b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u06274ba4\" id=\"u06274ba4\">在c文件添加头文件：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u11b933d8\" id=\"u11b933d8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6ee31008\" id=\"u6ee31008\">#include &quot;cJSON.h&quot;</span></code></li></ul><ul list=\"u2339dacd\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"uf2198490\" data-lake-id=\"u3532d219\" id=\"u3532d219\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc4e9a51e\" id=\"uc4e9a51e\">python的JSON数据解析官方示例：</span><a href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/json.html\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"uc56d74dd\" id=\"uc56d74dd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u43df775f\" id=\"u43df775f\">https://docs.python.org/3/library/json.html</span></a></li><li fid=\"uf2198490\" data-lake-id=\"u743745f6\" id=\"u743745f6\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf12dd18e\" id=\"uf12dd18e\">使用cJSON解析JSON数据：</span><a href=\"https://github.com/DaveGamble/cJSON\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"uf3cd3c73\" id=\"uf3cd3c73\"><span data-lake-id=\"u62b24aff\" id=\"u62b24aff\">https://github.com/DaveGamble/cJSON</span></a></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%23include%20%3Cstdlib.h%3E%5Cn%23include%20%5C%22cJSON.h%5C%22%5Cnint%20parse_json_str(const%20char%20*%20const%20monitor)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20const%20cJSON%20*resolution%20%3D%20NULL%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20const%20cJSON%20*resolutions%20%3D%20NULL%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20const%20cJSON%20*name%20%3D%20NULL%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20status%20%3D%200%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20cJSON%20*monitor_json%20%3D%20cJSON_Parse(monitor)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20(monitor_json%20%3D%3D%20NULL)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20const%20char%20*error_ptr%20%3D%20cJSON_GetErrorPtr()%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20(error_ptr%20!%3D%20NULL)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20fprintf(stderr%2C%20%5C%22Error%20before%3A%20%25s%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20error_ptr)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20status%20%3D%200%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20goto%20end%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20name%20%3D%20cJSON_GetObjectItemCaseSensitive(monitor_json%2C%20%5C%22name%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20(cJSON_IsString(name)%20%26%26%20(name-%3Evaluestring%20!%3D%20NULL))%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22Checking%20monitor%20%5C%5C%5C%22%25s%5C%5C%5C%22%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20name-%3Evaluestring)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20resolutions%20%3D%20cJSON_GetObjectItemCaseSensitive(monitor_json%2C%20%5C%22resolutions%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20cJSON_ArrayForEach(resolution%2C%20resolutions)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20cJSON%20*width%20%3D%20cJSON_GetObjectItemCaseSensitive(resolution%2C%20%5C%22width%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20cJSON%20*height%20%3D%20cJSON_GetObjectItemCaseSensitive(resolution%2C%20%5C%22height%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20(!cJSON_IsNumber(width)%20%7C%7C%20!cJSON_IsNumber(height))%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20status%20%3D%200%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20goto%20end%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22w%3A%20%25.1f%2C%20h%3A%20%25.1f%20%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20width-%3Evaluedouble%2C%20height-%3Evaluedouble)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20((width-%3Evaluedouble%20%3D%3D%201920)%20%26%26%20(height-%3Evaluedouble%20%3D%3D%201080))%20%7B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20status%20%3D%201%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%5Ct%5Ct%5Ctgoto%20end%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20end%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20cJSON_Delete(monitor_json)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%